<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>수행평가 관리</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>

<div id="page-setup" class="view-page">
  <div class="setup-container">
    <div class="setup-logo">🎓</div>
    <div class="setup-title">반 / 학기 맞춤 설정</div>
    <div class="setup-desc">학년과 반, 학기를 선택하시면<br>교육과정에 맞는 과목 세팅을 자동으로 도웁니다.</div>
    
    <div class="form-group" style="text-align: left;">
      <label>학년</label>
      <select id="setup-grade" onchange="updateClassOptions()">
        <option value="1">1학년</option>
        <option value="2">2학년</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    
    <div class="form-group" style="text-align: left;">
      <label>반</label>
      <select id="setup-class"></select>
    </div>
    
    <div class="form-group" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <label>학기</label>
      <select id="setup-term">
        <option value="1">1학기</option>
        <option value="2">2학기</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    
    <button class="btn-submit" onclick="submitSetup()">확인 및 시작하기</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="page-dashboard" class="view-page">
  <header>
    <div class="header-left">
      <div class="header-icon">📋</div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;">
        <h1>수행평가 관리</h1>
        <span class="class-info-badge" id="header-class-info" onclick="resetSetupData()">설정 재선택</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="api-status">
      <div class="dot" id="status-dot"></div>
      <span id="status-text">연결 중</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-label">전체</span>
        <span class="stat-value blue" id="stat-total">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-label">완료</span>
        <span class="stat-value green" id="stat-done">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-label">남은것</span>
        <span class="stat-value red" id="stat-remain">0</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-title">과목 필터</div>
        <button class="btn-manage" onclick="openSubjectModal()">과목 관리 ⚙️</button>
      </div>
      <div class="filter-row" id="filter-container"></div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="section-title">목록</div>
      <div class="task-list" id="task-list"></div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <button class="fab" id="fab" onclick="toggleModal()">+</button>
</div>

<div class="modal-overlay center-modal" id="subject-modal" onclick="closeSubjectModalOnOverlay(event)">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal-title">등록 과목 편집 및 관리</div>
    
    <div class="subject-add-inline">
      <input type="text" id="new-subject-input" placeholder="추가할 과목명 입력" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')addSubjectInline()"/>
      <button class="btn-inline-add" onclick="addSubjectInline()">추가</button>
    </div>

    <label style="margin-bottom: 6px; display: block;">등록된 과목 리스트</label>
    <div class="subject-manage-box" id="subject-manage-list"></div>

    <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeSubjectModal()">닫기</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="confirm-overlay" id="confirm-overlay">
  <div class="confirm-box">
    <div class="confirm-title">삭제할까요?</div>
    <div class="confirm-desc">삭제하면 되돌릴 수 없어요</div>
    <div class="confirm-btns">
      <button class="confirm-cancel" onclick="closeConfirm()">취소</button>
      <button class="confirm-ok" id="confirm-ok-btn">삭제</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-overlay" onclick="closeOnOverlay(event)">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal-handle"></div>
    <div class="modal-title">새 수행평가 추가</div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>과목</label>
      <div class="custom-select" id="custom-select">
        <div class="custom-select-btn" id="select-btn" onclick="toggleDropdown()">
          <span id="select-label">과목 선택</span>
          <span class="custom-select-arrow">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="custom-select-dropdown" id="select-dropdown"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>수행평가 제목</label>
      <input type="text" id="title" placeholder="예) 독서 감상문 쓰기" />
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>마감일</label>
      <input type="date" id="due" />
    </div>

    <button class="btn-submit" onclick="addTask()">추가하기</button>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="module" src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
